1. `Passing by reference` : for(auto &x : s1){if(x == 'G'){x = 'B';}} --> here our &x 
    will work as a alias and which will take value of s1 one by one and this take value 
    by reference and modify directly value if satisfy's our condition.
    
2. `return And break inside for loop` --> 
	1. **`break`**: Exits **only the loop**. Execution continues with the very next
	line of code immediately following the loop block.
	2. **`return`**: Exits the **entire function**. Both the loop and the function
	stop immediately, and control goes back to wherever the function was called. 
	3. And whenever using any of these make sure to use braces with if statement 
	other wise they will run in unwanted manner.
